# FreeRADIUS configuration must use LF endings.
#
# With CRLF, a line continuation becomes a backslash followed by CR, which the
# FreeRADIUS 3 parser reads as an escaped space rather than a continuation. The
# query string then silently runs on and the next statement is swallowed:
#
#     queries.conf[72]: Unterminated string
#
# Unlang is affected the same way, and a `}` at the end of a CRLF line is not
# matched reliably, which produced "Too many closing braces".
deploy/freeradius/** text eol=lf
deploy/install-vps.sh text eol=lf